[00:10.94]1. Jesus loved to share truth and light,
[00:16.44]Bringing happiness to our life.
[00:21.94]On a mountainside, he taught us how to live.
[00:31.77]Seeking God’s will first ev’ry day,
[00:37.82]With a humble heart, he would pray.
[00:42.82]He was kind to all and ready to forgive.
[00:49.82]By God’s light, I can see
[00:55.13]How to live happily.
[01:00.44]By God’s light, I am truly free.
[01:06.44]Happy are these eyes because they see!
[01:25.71]2. When anxieties come our way,
[01:27.47]We will live our lives day by day,
[01:32.71]For Jehovah’s hand provides our daily needs.
[01:42.91]As the lilies grow in the field,
[01:48.31]How the love God shows is revealed!
[01:53.71]If he cares for them, I know he’ll care for me.
[02:00.91]By God’s light, I can see
[02:04.46]How to live happily.
[02:11.66]By God’s light, I am truly free.
[02:17.66]Happy are these eyes because they see!
[02:28.08]3. We will build on rock, not on sand.
[02:38.49]If a storm should come, we will stand.
[02:44.49]Yes, Jehovah’s Word will live in all we do.
[02:58.75]Through the narrow gate, we will go.
[03:01.53]As he guides our way, blessings flow,
[03:04.32]And it leads to life, where all will be made new.
[03:13.72]By God’s light, I can see
[03:17.64]How to live happily.
[03:23.55]By God’s light, I am truly free.
[03:29.55]Happy are these eyes because they see!